#: ../../worker.md:2
msgid "Worker delegation"
msgstr "Worker 委派"

#: ../../worker.md:4
msgid ""
"A **worker** is a second minacode session running in the same process. "
"When the model meets a bounded task that deserves an independent look — a"
" review, a refactor, a second opinion — it hands the task over with the "
"`Delegate` tool."
msgstr ""
"**worker** 是运行在同一个进程里的第二个 minacode "
"会话。当模型遇到一个值得独立看一眼的有界任务——评审、重构、第二意见——它会用 `Delegate` 工具把这个任务交出去。"

#: ../../worker.md:8
msgid ""
"The worker has its own provider, its own system prompt, and a reduced "
"tool set, and keeps its context across delegations until you reset it. It"
" never calls back into the parent: a delegation is a detour that ends by "
"returning its result."
msgstr ""
"worker 有自己的 "
"provider、自己的系统提示词和一套精简的工具，并且在你重置它之前会一直保留上下文。它从不回调父会话：一次委派就是一段绕行，结束时把结果带回来。"

#: ../../worker.md:12
msgid ""
"The point is pairing models by cost. A large model orchestrates as the "
"parent; the worker's tasks arrive already bounded and spec'd, so a small "
"cheap model handles them at a fraction of the parent's rate."
msgstr ""
"它的意义在于按成本搭配模型。大模型作为父会话负责调度；交给 worker "
"的任务本身已经有边界、有规格，因此小而便宜的模型就能完成，花费只是父会话费率的一小部分。"

#: ../../worker.md:16
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速上手"

#: ../../worker.md:18
msgid ""
"The parent orchestrates, so it usually runs the larger model; the worker "
"runs bounded tasks, so a faster, cheaper entry is enough for it — ideally"
" from a **different vendor** than `provider.active`, so its reviews "
"cross-validate the parent's. Point `[worker] provider` at that entry and "
"turn on `[runtime] worker`:"
msgstr ""
"父级负责编排，所以通常跑更大的模型；worker 跑有界任务，一个更快、更便宜的条目就够用——最好与 `provider.active` "
"来自**不同厂商**，这样它的审查能与父级互相验证。把 `[worker] provider` 指向该条目并打开 `[runtime] "
"worker`："

#: ../../worker.md:48
msgid ""
"The model decides when to delegate. When it does, it writes the `order` "
"itself and asks you to approve the send; the worker then takes over the "
"terminal until it answers, and its answer goes back to the parent, which "
"decides what to do next."
msgstr ""
"何时委派由模型决定。当它决定委派时，会自己写下 `order` 并请你批准这次发送；随后 worker "
"接管终端直到给出回答，回答再回到父会话，由它决定下一步。"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "`/worker`"
msgstr "`/worker`"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "Show its provider, model, state, and rounds"
msgstr "显示它的 provider、模型、状态与轮数"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "`/worker on` · `/worker off`"
msgstr "`/worker on` · `/worker off`"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "Allow or stop delegation for this session"
msgstr "允许或停止本次会话的委派"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "`/worker reset`"
msgstr "`/worker reset`"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "Clear the worker's context"
msgstr "清空 worker 的上下文"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "`/worker provider NAME`"
msgstr "`/worker provider NAME`"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "Point it at another provider entry"
msgstr "把它指向另一个 provider 条目"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "`/worker model` · `reason` · `api`"
msgstr "`/worker model` · `reason` · `api`"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "Override one field of that entry; `default` restores it"
msgstr "覆盖该条目的某一个字段；`default` 恢复继承"

#: ../../worker.md:60
msgid "[Commands](commands.md) has the full syntax."
msgstr "[命令](commands.md)里有完整语法。"

#: ../../worker.md:62
msgid "What you see"
msgstr "你会看到什么"

#: ../../worker.md:64
msgid "The delegation bracket"
msgstr "委派分界规则"

#: ../../worker.md:66
msgid ""
"Two full-width rules bracket a delegation: a yellow `worker start` rule "
"with the worker's live provider and model plus the order's title (or "
"first line), the worker's streamed lines, then a yellow `worker done` "
"rule with the step count, elapsed time, tokens in and out, and the files "
"it touched."
msgstr ""
"两条全宽规则框住一次委派：一条黄色的 `worker start` 规则，带 worker 当前的 provider、模型和 order "
"标题（或首行）；接着是 worker 的流式输出行；最后是一条黄色的 `worker done` 规则，带步骤数、耗时、输入输出 token "
"数和它改动的文件。"

#: ../../worker.md:73
msgid "Status bar while delegating"
msgstr "委派期间的状态栏"

#: ../../worker.md:75
msgid ""
"While the worker runs, the status bar swaps the parent's row for the "
"worker's: a `[worker]` marker, then the worker's provider and model, its "
"reasoning effort, and its context fill with cache ratio."
msgstr ""
"worker 运行时，状态栏把父级那一行换成 worker 的：一个 `[worker]` 标记，然后是 worker 的 provider "
"与模型、它的推理力度，以及它的上下文占用与缓存比例。"

#: ../../worker.md:81
msgid "The send approval brief"
msgstr "发送审批简报"

#: ../../worker.md:83
msgid ""
"Every `Delegate send` asks for approval, even under `yolo` — the "
"confirmation prints the title, a one-line excerpt of the order, any "
"explicit `language` or `max_steps`, and the effective worker "
"provider/model/effort/api, with `(inherit)` marking a field that inherits"
" the provider entry's value. A refused send feeds your reason back to the"
" model."
msgstr ""
"每次 `Delegate send` 都需要审批，即使在 `yolo` 下也一样——确认会打印标题、order 的单行摘录、任何显式的 "
"`language` 或 `max_steps`，以及生效的 worker "
"provider/model/effort/api，`(inherit)` 标记表示该字段继承 provider "
"条目的值。被拒绝的发送会把你的理由反馈给模型。"

#: ../../worker.md:88
msgid ""
"The actions sit in a row above the input line, `Approve` selected to "
"begin with. `Tab` and the arrows move the highlight — above, two presses "
"have landed on `View order` — and `Enter` fires whatever is highlighted:"
msgstr ""
"这些操作排成一行位于输入行上方，初始选中 `Approve`。`Tab` 和方向键移动高亮——上图中"
"按了两次 Tab，落在 `View order` 上——`Enter` 执行当前高亮的操作："

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "按键"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "`Enter`"
msgstr "`Enter`"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "do the selected action — `Approve` unless you moved"
msgstr "执行当前选中的动作 —— 没有移动过就是 `Approve`"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "`Tab` / `→` / `Shift-Tab` / `←`"
msgstr "`Tab` / `→` / `Shift-Tab` / `←`"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "move along the row"
msgstr "在行内移动"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "`Esc`"
msgstr "`Esc`"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "refuse without a reason"
msgstr "拒绝，不带理由"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "anything printable"
msgstr "任何可打印字符"

#: ../../worker.md
msgid "start writing a refusal reason"
msgstr "开始写拒绝理由"

#: ../../worker.md:99
msgid ""
"Typing always goes to the reason, so no letter is ever a shortcut and no "
"reason is unwritable. While you are typing, the row dims and `Enter` "
"sends the reason instead; `Esc` takes the reason back and returns to the "
"row, and refuses only once there is nothing left to take back."
msgstr ""
"输入永远进入理由，因此没有任何字母被占作快捷键，也就没有写不出的理由。正在输入时，动作行变暗、`Enter` 改为发送理由；`Esc` "
"先收回理由退回动作行，只有在没有东西可收回时才表示拒绝。"

#: ../../worker.md:103
msgid ""
"Every tool's approval works this way — non-`Delegate` ones simply offer "
"`Approve` and `Refuse`. Without a TUI (piped input, a headless run) the "
"row is gone and the same actions are typed out: `y`, `n`, `v`, `c`, each "
"followed by Enter."
msgstr ""
"每个工具的确认都是这套交互 —— 非 `Delegate` 的只是少几个动作，只有 `Approve` 和 `Refuse`。没有 TUI "
"时（管道输入、无界面运行）没有这一行，同样的动作改为完整输入：`y`、`n`、`v`、`c`，每个后面加 Enter。"

#: ../../worker.md:109
msgid ""
"`View order` opens the full order in a read-only viewer — the same field "
"rows, then the order itself rendered as markdown. Scroll it, then `Esc` "
"back to the actions."
msgstr ""
"`View order` 会在只读查看器里打开完整的 order —— 同样的字段行，然后是按 markdown 渲染的 order "
"本身。可以滚动查看，`Esc` 返回操作行。"

#: ../../worker.md:114
msgid "When nothing delegates"
msgstr "当什么都没有被委派时"

#: ../../worker.md:116
msgid ""
"Delegation is the model's call, not a command you run — there is no way "
"to force one. If a session never delegates, check in this order:"
msgstr "委派由模型决定，不是你运行的命令——没有办法强制发起一次。如果一个会话始终没有委派，按以下顺序检查："

#: ../../worker.md:119
msgid ""
"`/worker` — it reports the configured entry, or `worker: no active "
"session` with the `[worker] provider` it would use."
msgstr ""
"`/worker` —— 它会报告配置的条目，或者在没有 worker 时显示 `worker: no active session` "
"以及它将会使用的 `[worker] provider`。"

#: ../../worker.md:121
msgid ""
"`[worker] provider` and `[runtime] worker` in your config, or `/worker "
"on` for this session."
msgstr "配置里的 `[worker] provider` 与 `[runtime] worker`，或者用 `/worker on` 打开本次会话的委派。"

#: ../../worker.md:122
msgid ""
"**Whether delegation was available when the session started.** If "
"`[worker] provider` was unset at startup, the model was never offered the"
" tool, and turning it on now applies to the next session. Changing the "
"provider mid-session is fine — that only re-targets a delegation the "
"model already has."
msgstr ""
"**会话启动时委派是否可用。** 如果启动时 `[worker] provider` "
"是空的，模型从一开始就没有拿到这个工具，现在打开要到下一个会话才生效。会话中途更换 provider "
"没有问题——那只是把模型已经拥有的委派重新指向别处。"

#: ../../worker.md:127
msgid ""
"Otherwise the model simply saw no task worth handing over, which is the "
"normal case for short work."
msgstr "否则就只是模型没有看到值得交出去的任务，这在短任务里很正常。"

#: ../../worker.md:129
msgid "Good to know"
msgstr "值得知道的几点"

#: ../../worker.md:131
msgid ""
"**Reset drops the conversation, not the work.** `/worker reset` clears "
"the worker's context — along with any wrong beliefs it picked up — while "
"file changes and merged diffs survive."
msgstr ""
"**重置丢掉的是对话，不是工作成果。** `/worker reset` 会清空 worker "
"的上下文——连同它可能积累的错误认知——而文件改动和已合并的 diff 都会保留。"

#: ../../worker.md:133
msgid ""
"**Every send asks, even under `yolo`.** The order is a spec the model "
"wrote for itself, so the approval brief is the one cheap check on it."
msgstr "**每一次发送都会询问，即使在 `yolo` 下也一样。** order 是模型给自己写的规格，因此这份审批简报是对它唯一的低成本检查。"

#: ../../worker.md:135
msgid ""
"**The worker inherits your environment.** Same directory, skills, MCP "
"servers, and language setting; the files and the repository are what both"
" actually share."
msgstr "**worker 继承你的环境。** 同一个目录、skills、MCP 服务器和语言设置；真正由双方共享的是文件和这个仓库。"

#: ../../worker.md:137
msgid ""
"**Its tokens are its own.** The worker bills to its own entry and keeps "
"its own context, and `/status` gives it separate rows — provider and "
"model, context fill with round count, and cache ratio — so a delegation "
"never blurs into the parent's numbers."
msgstr ""
"**它的 token 是它自己的。** worker 按自己的条目计费、保有自己的上下文，`/status` "
"也会给它单独的几行——provider 与模型、上下文占用与轮数、缓存命中率——因此一次委派不会和父会话的数字混在一起。"

#: ../../worker.md:140
msgid ""
"**Its sessions are not yours to manage.** Worker snapshots ride along "
"with the parent's and never appear in `/sessions`; when the parent's "
"snapshot expires, the worker's goes with it."
msgstr "**它的会话不需要你管理。** worker 的快照随父会话一起保存，不会出现在 `/sessions` 里；父会话的快照过期时，它的也一起过期。"

